3. DATA

   The datasets in data/ and fixtures/ are derived from the Sectors Financial
   API and from Indonesian government records published via the ESDM Minerba
   portal. They are included solely so that a reviewer can reproduce the build
   without API credentials.

   They remain subject to the terms of their originating sources, which take
   precedence over this licence. Nothing here grants any right to redistribute
   or commercially exploit that data. See DATA.md.


